{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：09:00 2026-10-18 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"錢嘉樂陪氣質外母行街全程陪笑勁識做  湯盈盈一個細微舉動洩14年夫妻恩愛程度\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3dd37d6562a4c67f21d4a0cc251f1f96/2026-10/Copy_of_Copy_of_KF_112.png\"/>\n<p>圈中模範夫妻錢嘉樂與湯盈盈結婚14年、育有兩名女兒，一直非常恩愛。日前有網民在街頭巧遇這對星級夫婦，同行的還有湯盈盈媽媽！當天三人打扮低調樸素，錢嘉樂和太太身穿全黑休閒服，而湯媽媽則精神飽滿地走在身旁。三人並肩在行人路等待過馬路，期間錢嘉樂不時與外母有說有笑，主動照顧長輩的舉動極具風度，盡顯這位「半邊仔」的孝順與貼心，畫面既溫馨又貼地。</p>\n<h2>湯盈盈細心體貼照顧錢嘉樂</h2>\n<p>在等候紅綠燈的短暫片刻，湯盈盈突然伸出手，非常細心地在街頭為老公錢嘉樂整理略顯凌亂的頭髮與面部儀容。這個充滿愛意、細微卻自然的日常舉動，完全展現出兩人相處多年的默契。雖然有媽媽在旁，但湯盈盈對老公的關懷依然無微不至，街頭一幕簡直甜度爆燈，猶如熱戀中的年輕情侶，無意間洩露了兩人堅貞不移的夫妻感情。</p>\n<img alt=\"湯盈盈母親（右）與女兒湯盈盈（中）十足餅印。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c3dc951976c602b0b38846214d1d90e2/2024-01/YINGYING_006.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"湯盈盈（左）與媽咪好似樣！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5479e60263d2d399d7755cb2550f04b6/2024-01/YINGYING_008.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"湯盈盈曾表示暫未打算送兩個女去加拿大讀書，反而游說媽媽返港居住，方便照顧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f18eb91072ea8a24f7d3eedb017e0356/2022-08/100_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"日前有網民在街頭巧遇這對星級夫婦，同行的還有湯盈盈媽媽！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/99bfe575b2ff36a367aa63d202e62473/2026-10/1_4_75.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"湯盈盈細心體貼照顧錢嘉樂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/144c843d16249bd280983f7cc7a7f1c3/2026-10/2_2_71.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"湯盈盈突然伸出手，非常細心地在街頭為老公錢嘉樂整理略顯凌亂的頭髮與面部儀容。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/846bbfe4e3f2868a0f77490a39797095/2026-10/3_24_64.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"這個充滿愛意、細微卻自然的日常舉動，完全展現出兩人相處多年的默契。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5b09827d8e6c5cfb96ee551e21236d6a/2026-10/4_8_58.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"湯盈盈還有一位餅印哥哥（右）。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f36a13cfb334dd8d129da134f2210600/2024-03/432456534_852539186886594_4312756363497280555_n.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"湯盈盈小時候的樣子很可愛！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2fbe950e8fc9caa9ddf9d2f2fbe8d992/2024-02/002_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"湯盈盈曾公開童年照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/58e07ec454e1566602dd7e618031ef54/2024-02/002_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"湯盈盈全家都好似樣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be451c3241644d7bcba838ef9c621357/2024-02/002_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"錢嘉樂與湯盈盈2012年與錢嘉樂在海洋公園熊貓館舉行婚禮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/86d16e8389aaddeadfb607a3fd985b97/2023-08/img_0319.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"湯盈盈2013年3月誕下大女錢凱晴（Alyssa）。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/955b08b2163cfc3c8098612e173455b0/2023-08/img-20130312-wa0004.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Alyssa細個已經被網民被指似爸爸錢嘉樂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/62993227b3d99df05adac6432712341f/2023-08/qianjiale4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Alyssa現時已是少女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/46d9e567fad2587955cc2803ecedcba9/2023-08/10979642_1582885855328750_803593378_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Alyssa小時候很可愛！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5921333a5a9f5c862c834d749ce15173/2023-08/11311604_1617666105151335_1152695387_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Alyssa 2015年8月榮升家姐。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f03f79e798a2cff34cceaaf1e91bfb68/2023-08/12080646_927394327345184_379743403_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"湯盈盈以前經常分享大女Alyssa的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5ec53154409d482e625b25afe130b4cc/2023-08/12545276_864389206992428_857384237_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"湯盈盈與錢嘉樂有兩名女兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/12aa67e2eccea8b511c7432f215dd205/2023-08/13092470_1796464667244061_1994115517_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"湯盈盈的媽媽高貴優雅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/310eec0ed0aeb90ce799f1c64eb7a435/2024-02/tong_ying_ying_1708852587_3310417900380722797_1604991845.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"湯盈盈曾分享舉家同遊主題樂園的相片，有網民笑言看見多個湯盈盈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/91fc5f4ec863e12600d3edacea5bec85/2024-02/tong_ying_ying_1708852587_3310417900472906796_1604991845.jpg\"/>\n<h2>網民激讚錢嘉樂湯盈盈孝順</h2>\n<p>面對太太「愛的整理」，錢嘉樂隨即露出極度燦爛且滿足的「冧笑」，隨後更開心伸手摸了摸自己的頭髮，幸福之情溢於言表。網民看過片段後紛紛大讚錢嘉樂與湯盈盈「平淡中見真愛」、「帶埋媽媽一齊行街好溫馨」，直指他們不僅是令人稱羨的恩愛夫妻，更是娛樂圈中與長輩融洽相處的孝順榜樣。</p>\n<h2>錢嘉樂湯盈盈兩名女兒近照曝光？</h2>\n<img alt=\"錢嘉樂與湯盈盈在2012年於海洋公園舉行的婚禮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7c37e788296f7f2e53397cb16366edb6/2024-08/76e3c36bjw1dytgbwtuhhj.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"錢嘉樂61歲生日，獲太太湯盈盈及兩位千金陪伴在側，一家四口溫馨同框。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/894a6fb35fad1be3c45a335b9dc65103/2026-08/1_8_14.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"一家人為壽星仔錢嘉樂唱生日歌，場面熱鬧又溫馨。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bf7783bb23962b1363b4037f074579bd/2026-08/9_5_0.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"錢嘉樂與女兒互動頻繁，父女情深。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/764857323e369404205b26f8a372e0b1/2026-08/8_5_4.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"壽星仔錢嘉樂在吹蠟燭前，細心與女兒們交流。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7fb985b2301e6e41e6449aa127e816e2/2026-08/7_3_5.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"錢嘉樂在兩個精緻的生日蛋糕前誠心許願，女兒們乖巧地陪伴在旁。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/388af3c932712940b73f91aac1278385/2026-08/6_4_17.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"錢嘉樂與細女一同吹熄其中一個生日蛋糕上的蠟燭，大女在旁守候。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/55f6c14f9dd481845f93b42200912c78/2026-08/5_4_10.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"壽星仔錢嘉樂邀請大女一起吹蠟燭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0badad236aeca12bfd90d1a03a9b3c0d/2026-08/4_7_13.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"錢嘉樂示意女兒們吹蠟燭，盡顯對女兒的愛錫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7e8a38a268a5b5b5ec7e6f93b7b4c72d/2026-08/3_6_10.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"大女錢凱晴（Alyssa）盡顯長姐風範，將大部份蠟燭都讓給妹妹吹熄。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6efd36f8d8d2c19946bea8fa5cc8296e/2026-08/2_7_19.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"久違了的錢凱晴外貌變得更有少女味。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8aa2910442562b0df487d3b426f91972/2026-06/UD_tong_ying_ying_3924343161394235509_1604991845_2026_6_22_mp4_snapshot_00_00_299.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"湯盈盈貼出與兩個女兒錢凱晴和錢凱琪為錢嘉樂慶祝父親節的相片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1da2c6ac5d1de6ab94f6560601875185/2026-06/UD_tong_ying_ying_3924343161394235509_1604991845_2026_6_22_mp4_snapshot_00_03_045.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"不少網民大讚他們是圈中的模範家庭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d6d14eb3a37233e364c5476251410a23/2026-06/UD_tong_ying_ying_3924343161394235509_1604991845_2026_6_22_mp4_snapshot_00_04_662.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"錢嘉樂對兩個女如珠如寶。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f8ed3355556d4a63e4e80380e80a869b/2026-06/UD_tong_ying_ying_3924343161394235509_1604991845_2026_6_22_mp4_snapshot_00_05_612.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"錢嘉樂臉上流露一臉慈父相，畫面非常有愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c8f2833f7770a440c44b326d5f2a1bc7/2026-06/UD_tong_ying_ying_3924343161394235509_1604991845_2026_6_22_mp4_snapshot_00_06_477.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"錢嘉樂大女Alyssa小時候很可愛！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5921333a5a9f5c862c834d749ce15173/2023-08/11311604_1617666105151335_1152695387_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大女Alyssa 2015年8月榮升家姐。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f03f79e798a2cff34cceaaf1e91bfb68/2023-08/12080646_927394327345184_379743403_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Alyssa兒時最鍾意公主look。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2d1191a1b6b35a48adfe5f40ac51df2f/2023-08/28433981_727039161019421_4864032256353632256_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"湯盈盈經常湊囡囡去玩。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c614e1adfe65c4bb152544fc489408e7/2023-08/43778482_251350735452789_1094977258893637986_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"同妹妹差2年多。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9b53fc4dabcf1485c2021b1f2afef055/2023-08/53919149_885832871747648_3332697979368335527_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"一家四口成日去玩。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/29b570af76e9d146b877fea75c2ca151/2023-08/63818463_2311165415809856_7094721402791635893_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"妹妹似媽媽湯盈盈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f9ecb3c395b6c3fe2dfd9f132e5a033d/2023-08/67796733_386760755345389_2503053375845109493_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"又會一家去staycation。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f24116253d8258da0d10ab2787d813db/2023-08/166266065_199082151659555_1278415237102259596_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網民覺得越大越似爸爸。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a137faf2af0fc4380030a25ddc42fbbf/2023-08/308055192_6041070112576222_984359954635772885_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"一家四口合照，大女Alyssa長得特別高。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d61b715c24701c01d4528a9380e762d/2023-09/tong_ying_ying_380337496_18391395157063846_9051973553162431325_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"為了兩個女，錢嘉樂與湯盈盈付出不少心力。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/044e8812cb80812ffb3c0431416c2d2b/2023-09/tong_ying_ying_380315838_18391395184063846_7280236263176338332_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"錢嘉樂父愛氾濫！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bfd3506c3b94b6c3d51032bd3067c8dc/2024-02/tong_ying_ying_1708852587_3310417900246476487_1604991845.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"細女個樣好得意！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f86097c96ff282ac6c6845569291192c/2024-02/tong_ying_ying_1708852587_3310417900254807218_1604991845.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"錢嘉樂與大女成個餅印！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4240a36d77b3a1db1c1d5b754ec5d9d9/2024-02/tong_ying_ying_1708852587_3310417900254825952_1604991845.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"湯盈盈的外貌同哥哥很相似！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c4aafd2b492778257dd807da1979278/2024-02/tong_ying_ying_1708852587_3310417900263308002_1604991845.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"錢凱晴（左）和錢凱琪長高了不少。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/44bbc75a6def4f4e4f320a1167b002b0/2024-02/tong_ying_ying_1708852587_3310417900372297553_1604991845.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大女錢凱晴身形差不多已經追近了媽咪。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2c1fd35280eb66faa32e2b9bc553caa4/2024-02/tong_ying_ying_1708852587_3310417900254935240_1604991845.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"錢嘉樂和湯盈盈一家四口生活很開心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bc758ccb2f7fd97ce44985b542eb9791/2024-02/tong_ying_ying_1704095956_3270516381254791424_1604991845.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"湯盈盈與大女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/360d3fe5194b54497ce1d64fb00fbffc/2023-03/tong_ying_ying_336069870_1279045799664357_7854436040914810941_n%20%281%29.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T01:12:41.379215+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":520,"images":56,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T01:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T03:38:18.738675+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T01:11:29.385885+00:00","content_hash":"25a36de754b8480f53dc0874002238df9a5ba44a30c7d89192134ac783cc6dad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}